## 5. Key Workflows & Data Flows

### 5.1 Real-Time SCADA Telemetry Flow
1.  `simulator.py` generates new measurements.
2.  `ws_handler.py` broadcasts the telemetry payload via WebSockets.
3.  `scada_sld_v4.js` receives the payload, updates the UI components (breakers, busbars, transformers), and triggers visual alarms if thresholds are exceeded.

